  "description": "A beautiful and romantic embroidery design capturing the silhouette of a newly married couple in a tender embrace. This elegant design depicts the groom lifting his bride, suggesting a moment of pure joy and love, perhaps during their first dance or a celebratory lift. Rendered entirely in a single, delicate shade of shimmering pink or rose gold, the minimalist style focuses on the loving pose. The high-quality, dense stitching creates a lovely texture, making this a perfect embellishment for wedding gifts, anniversary keepsakes, ring pillows, elegant table linens, or personalizing bridal party accessories.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>A beautiful and romantic embroidery design capturing the silhouette of a newly married couple in a tender embrace. This elegant design depicts the groom lifting his bride, suggesting a moment of pure joy and love, perhaps during their first dance or a celebratory lift. Rendered entirely in a single, delicate shade of shimmering pink or rose gold, the minimalist style focuses on the loving pose. The high-quality, dense stitching creates a lovely texture, making this a perfect embellishment for wedding gifts, anniversary keepsakes, ring pillows, elegant table linens, or personalizing bridal party accessories.</p>",
